  "proposal": [
    "Use separate module and project ArtifactViews over each original debugRuntimeClasspath and releaseRuntimeClasspath configuration.",
    "Module componentFilter view has no added artifact attributes and preserves raw external JAR/AAR files, component identity and locations.",
    "Project componentFilter view adds only the selected secondary artifact type; no withVariantReselection, retaining original parent build-type attributes.",
    "Wire both configuration views file collections into lazy dependsOn before task action; actual positive runs both classes producers.",
    "Require explicit selected-component coverage. lenient(false) alone permits an empty typed project view.",
    "Exempt exact resolution root identity only. A selected platform-category metadata-only module can lack an artifact; preserve existing independently validated primary POM/source/license/coordinate proof and never exempt arbitrary missing modules.",
    "Keep unknown components, missing artifacts, absent producers, unrecognized metadata and every existing closed-SDK/permission/source/license guard fail-closed."
  ],
